        <label>Zoophagical distaste</label>
        <description>This pawn dislikes having animals as prey. Maybe it can't bear to see its fuzzy friends imperiled, maybe it thinks cannibalism is the true way, maybe it just doesn't like to get dirt and fur all over its tongue.</description>
